You are a worker session of a coordinator session working on the Ergopti repository (adrienm7/ergopti), branch dev. The maintainer is away; the coordinator integrates your work into dev.

RULES (strict):
- Create and work on your own branch `agent/win-par-14-pac` from the current `origin/dev`. Push ONLY that branch (`git push -u origin agent/win-par-14-pac`), early and after every commit, so the coordinator can pick commits as they come. Pushing `agent/*` triggers no CI. NEVER push `dev`, `main` or `fix/*`, never open a pull request, never force-push anything but your own branch.
